        <mxCell id="6s-YkWv6jdrgx6Vm8d82-58" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;Review PRs linked to SOs using &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot; data-end=&quot;80&quot; data-start=&quot;64&quot;&gt;T-Code: ME57&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;Check &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot; data-end=&quot;116&quot; data-start=&quot;93&quot;&gt;credit block status&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt; (Finance).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;Verify &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot; data-end=&quot;165&quot; data-start=&quot;140&quot;&gt;line manager approval&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt; (User Status).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot; data-end=&quot;201&quot; data-start=&quot;184&quot;&gt;For RLC only: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;Check &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot; data-end=&quot;235&quot; data-start=&quot;213&quot;&gt;PG approval status&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;- If article number is missing, notify Customer Service.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;- Confirm vendor with PMM/CH/VM.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;- Validate &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot; data-end=&quot;375&quot; data-start=&quot;349&quot;&gt;product specifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt; against Quote/SO and Schedule.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot; data-end=&quot;238&quot; data-start=&quot;184&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFE0;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontColor=#484848;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=9;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=10;meaKind=note;" parent="1" vertex="1">
